  "display_fullname": "Prestige Prestige Attacks Brawl Tranq",
  "display_help": "Thanks to the advances of science, you know have access to a basic chemical weapon: the Tranq Dart. This attack can be used at short range to deal minor Lethal and Toxic damage to a target. In addition there is a small chance you can put the target to Sleep with this dart, but they will wake up the next time they are damaged or healed. This power receives a damage bonus that decreases after you reach level 10. At around level 17 you stop benefiting from this power's damage bonus altogether. Damage: Minor",
  "display_short_help": "Ranged Minor DMG(Lethal/Toxic), Foe Sleep",
